    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- watch the demo illustrating a vague code request resulting in unreadable code\r\n- observe the demo showing a specific code request generating clear, useful code\r\n- locate the controls that add details to the code request\r\n- flip the switches to see how a small piece of code changes based on your input\r\n- notice how adding details makes the generated code more understandable and functional",
